b_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One Main Mystery, Dozens of Detours</strong> \u2013 Solve the core case, or get sidetracked by over 50 false endings, each with its own twisted mini-mystery.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No Fail States</strong> \u2013 The week-long investigation ends no matter what, but your choices\u2014and missed clues\u2014shape the outcome.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Zoom Beyond the Surface</strong> \u2013 Get close enough to read notes, see tiny details, or even peek <i>behind</i> objects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every Object Matters</strong> \u2013 Nearly everything is searchable and interactable, down to screws in the wall and scuff marks on the floor.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Time is Your Enemy</strong> \u2013 Every action costs time. Decide what\u2019s worth investigating and what's worth leaving.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mature Dark Humor</strong> \u2013 1990s satire that\u2019s sharp, absurd, and occasionally uncomfortably real.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meet the Misfits:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103560/extras/a2c19bda2d10f163b7dd75d9e82fcb39.avif?t=1761766250\" width=616 height=308 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103560/extras/f099725af70cc3752a965bc47abe781a.avif?t=1761766250\" width=616 height=308 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103560/extras/e7bb1102913a2562f17f4987f46cf112.avif?t=1761766250\" width=616 height=308 /></s